    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65167" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαστί̆χ-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mastich</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τρώγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					338
				</span></i>
			; obtained from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχῖνος</span>,
				<i>mastich, Pistacia Lentiscus</i>, or from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰξίνη</span>, <i>pine-thistle, Atractylis
				gummifera</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.1.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.70
			</span></i>; the latter distd. as 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀκανθική</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					6.4.9
				</span></i>
			; used as a cosmetic, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Alex.</u>
				21
			</span></i>.</div>
